<td id="S4.T1.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">ALIGN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite></td>
