<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S4.F4.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Change an object</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Two settings of the customized similarity retrieval task.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance on the task of customized similarity retrieval. The symbol <sup id="S4.T3.5.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S4.T3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗</span></sup> means using the fine-tuned CLIP model weights.</span></figcaption>
