<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Ablation Studies</h2>

<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>LLM</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As for the selection of LLMs, we use the same prompt to query four mainstream LLMs: GPT-4o, Deepseek-v3, Gemini 2.5, and Claude 4. As can be seen in Table <a href="#A5.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ E.1 LLM ‣ Appendix E Ablation Studies ‣ Conditional Representation Learningfor Customized Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, our method does not particularly rely on any specific LLM.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A5.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Customized classification performance under different LLMs.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A5.T10.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:310.5pt;height:10.4pt;vertical-align:-4.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-403.6pt,13.4pt) scale(0.277825757338999,0.277825757338999) ;">
<table id="A5.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A5.T10.5.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Task</th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">GPT-4o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite></th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Deepseek-v3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite></th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Gemini 2.5 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">8</a>]</cite></th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Claude 4 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">3</a>]</cite></th>
<th id="A5.T10.5.1.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Std</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T10.5.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
