</span></div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>VLM Prompt</h3>

<div id="A5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As for the VLM prompt, we require it to contain the [criterion] and the generated [text] by the LLM. We also devise below 5 different templates:</p>
<ul id="A5.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1)</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">objects with the [criterion] of [text]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2)</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">a photo with the [criterion] of [text]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3)</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">itap with the [criterion] of [text]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.ix4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4)</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">art with the [criterion] of [text]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.ix5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5)</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.ix5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.ix5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">a cartoon with the [criterion] of [text]</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">As suggested in the Table <a href="#A5.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ E.4 VLM Prompt ‣ Appendix E Ablation Studies ‣ Conditional Representation Learningfor Customized Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, our method remains stable across different VLM prompts.</p>
</div>
